  "task": {
    "name": "Add a mapAsync helper",
    "description": "Add `mapAsync(items, fn)` in `src/map-async.mjs` as a named export. It calls `fn(item, index)` for every item concurrently and resolves to an array of the results in the same order as `items`, regardless of which call finishes first. If any call rejects, the returned promise rejects with that error. An empty input resolves to `[]`.",
